 d[7]={0};</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">d[2]+=1; d[5]-=1;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">for(int i=1;i&lt;=5;i++){</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">  d[i]+=d[i-1]; cout&lt;&lt;d[i]&lt;&lt;&quot; &quot;;</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">5</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>输出体现区间增量。</div></div>",
